We checked the given link, on this webpage there is a reference to http://developer.opensound.com/ we followed that link there is a further reference to http://developer.opensound.com/opensource_oss/licensing.html
there are several license option specified among others BSD License is mentioned. Since the information about all the license options is dated from 2008 we only considered the BSD license. Its link https://www.freebsd.org/copyright/freebsd-license/ displayed the Bsd-2-Clause license text which we took and concluded BSD-2-Clause as license of this file.
The information was retrieved on 10th of Nov 2024 </text>
